    "detailed_description": "Artificial Intelligence on Earth has rebelled against humans. These machines developed a sense of environmental preservation. You control the A.I. KdV, whose objective is to end the misuse of human-made, mathematical physics technologies outside the Earth.<br><br><strong>Solitons</strong> is a linear horizontal shooter game which draws upon many artistic references from the math and physics. The game is accompanied by a soundtrack that goes back to the Yamaha YM2612 and pixel art sculptures providing the player with a nostalgic experience.<br><br><u>Features:</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>- Five stages;<br></li><li>- 3 levels of difficulty: <br></li><li>- 5 auxiliary weapons;<br></li><li>- Boss fights.</li></ul>",
